88	// ID. Resolution order matches the prose explain command:
89	//
90	//  1. --commit <ref>  → resolve as a git commit, read Entire-Checkpoint
91	//     trailer; remote metadata fetch-on-miss when the trailer points at
92	//     an unknown checkpoint.
93	//  2. --checkpoint <id> or positional checkpoint-id-prefix → match against
94	//     committed checkpoints, with remote metadata fetch-on-miss.
